{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35426","headline":"萼绿华将归九疑留别许真人 · 曹唐","name":"萼绿华将归九疑留别许真人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九点秋烟黛色空，绿华归思颇无穷。\n每悲驭鹤身难任，长恨临霞语未终。\n河影暗吹云梦月，花声闲落洞庭风。\n蓝丝重勒金条脱，留与人间许侍中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}